# Files that must never be uploaded to Vercel.
#
# Without this, Vercel serves every repository file as a public static asset:
# the test suite, the database schema and internal audit notes were all
# downloadable from the deployed site.
#
# server/ is NOT listed: api/index.js bundles it into the function. Public
# requests to /server/* are blocked by the redirects in vercel.json instead.

test/
db/
docs/
ref/
_archive/
_backup*/
.claude/
.claudeignore
*.md
.env*
!.env.example
